== Advanced usage == 
If the Yggdrasil Leaf is boosted from at least 5 starred slots and hero's backpack also contains the [[Glowing Crown]], the crown will instantly use 10 {{icon/mana}} and trigger the invulnerability period at 0.0s, which in turn triggers the Yggdrasil Leaf's heal and cleanse abilities, which will likely be wasted.

== Trivia ==
[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yggdrasil Yggdrasil] is a sacred tree in Norse cosmology. Around it exists all else, including the Nine Worlds.

